@1088[2]. Under <Charity>, see this reference.

@1517. A vinous odour from those who, from friendship... flatter, so that there is truth in their blandishments. @SE 1047.

@9248. "Flattering divination" (Ezekiel 12:24).

@9265. Anything that pleases the natural man...

@HH 87. These things gratify the external senses... These gratify the internal senses.

@CL 294[6]. A soft and tender love...

@361[end]. The substances of the form become gentle, pleasant...

@365. His internal is in itself mild, pleasant...

@380[5]. We asked courteously...

@405[2]. Natural parents... fawning upon their children...

@505[4]. With a stern face instead of a courteous one.

@ISB 15[7]. Such things as please the senses...

@TCR 590[end]. A fiery spirit may dwell beneath a bland mouth.

@767. The natural sight, to which the other senses add their allurements.

@SE 1045. (Flatterers) have an odour of vomit...

@1179. Such conversation flattered their nature.

@2012. Something which flattered their self-love.

@2120. In the bodily life had been pleasant in countenance...

@2973[end]. The caressings of the black cow, and her reciprocal caressing.

@3843. They were complaisant to every cupidity...

@4339[end]. They who flatter anyone by speaking differently from what they think...

@5669[2]. Being exteriorly bland and civil...

@DMin 4705[end]. They are silent, bland, deceitful...

@AE 659[11]. "They flatter with their tongue" (Psalms 5:9) that exteriorly there is what is hypocritical and as it were sound.

Flattery.; Assentatio.
Flatterer.; Assentator.

@AC 5388. Flatteries differ according to the ends...

@HH 499. This is evident from pretenders and flatterers.

@DLW 393. (The cardiac and pulmonic motions) with hypocrites, flatterers, deceivers.

@DP 89[2]. Thus he acts the hypocrite and flatterer.

@104[2]. A flatterer and a hypocrite have a double thought.

@TCR 111. Hence come pretences, flatteries, and hypocrisies... @592[end].

@448[2]. I have seen such bindings... of many with flatterers...

@SE 1169. Such Spirits insinuate themselves into the affections of everyone... flattering them...

